  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Korzinka Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anglesey Food LLC (Korzinka or the Company) is the leading food retailer in Uzbekistan, operating under the Korzinka brand name. The Project involves construction of the Companys new distribution center in Tashkent with a total estimated project cost of approximately US$25 million (the Project). The Project will support the Companys growth and help address the countrys developmental challenges by increasing consumer access to quality food via a nationwide, modern retail chain. The new distribution center will consolidate Korzinkas logistics operations, increasing its operational efficiencies .</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will have significant development impact. The most significant, expected Project-level outcomes are i) increased access to modern retail for consumers in Uzbekistan and ii) job creation and preservation. Beyond the Project, IFC anticipates that the Project will promote financial integration through enabling a loan aligned with Islamic Finance Principles.</narrative>
  </description>
